<title>USA: San Antonio feeder cattle prices steady-firm-USDA.</title>
<headline>San Antonio feeder cattle prices steady-firm-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady to firm, compared to last week, USDA said.</p>
<p>Bulk of supply Medium and Large 1-2 300-600 lb feeder steers and heifers. Supply included around 15 percent slaughter cows and bulls; 30 percent feeder cattle over 600 lbs with balance mostly feeder cattle under 600 lbs.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 69.00- 79.00, pkg 80.00; 700-800 lbs 67.00-74.00; few 800-900 lbs 67.00-72.25. Medium and Large 1-2 - two pkgs 280 lbs 81.00-82.00; 300-400 lbs 80.50- 86.00; 400-500 lbs 70.00-81.00; 500-600 lbs 72.25-75.50; few 725-925 lbs 62.50-63.50. Holsteins - Large 2 - two pkgs 450-500 lbs 46.00-50.25; pkg 545 lbs 63.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 66.00-74.50; few 700-900 lbs 60.25-69.50. Medium and Large 1-2 - 500-850 lbs 55.00-62.75, pkg 68.50.</p>
<p>Receipts - 810    Last Week - 602   Last Year - 1,752</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
